    <NotesEn>&lt;div&gt;On May 24, 2024, the House of Commons ordered that the order for the second reading of Bill S-216, An Act to amend the Income Tax Act (use of resources of a registered charity), be discharged and the bill be withdrawn.&lt;/div&gt;</NotesEn>
